<title>INDIA: TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the $430,000 Indian Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>6-Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat 5-Alex Radulescu (Germany) 6-4 4-6 7-5. </p>
<p>Doubles:</p>
<p>3-Leander Paes/Mahesh Bhupathi (India) beat Oleg Ogorodov</p>
<p>(Uzbekistan)/Eyal Ran (Israel) 7-6 (7-4) 7-5</p>
</text>
